.TH SEMGET 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
semget \- get or create a System V semaphore set
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/sem.h>
.B int semget(key_t key, int count, int flags);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates or obtains a semaphore set.  Flags include permissions, IPC_CREAT and
IPC_EXCL; IPC_PRIVATE creates a private set.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the set identifier, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR semop (3crunch),
.BR semctl (3crunch),
.BR semget (2)
